 inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip, t-shirt oficial de oferta, seguro desportivo e abastecimentos de prova.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso levantar o dorsal e kit de atleta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado e levantamento de dorsais funcionam no centro de Vila Verde em hor\u00e1rios definidos pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 6 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma SincTime (www.sinctime.com).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66238,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[52,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57523","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-verde-braga","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-braga","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-vale-do-homem-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/57523","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=57523"}],"version-history":[{"co